     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Instrumental for jobs and company",
     "texto": [
      "After **być** («to be») the job noun can take the instrumental: **jestem lekarzem**. With **z** («with») the instrumental also appears: **z koleżanką**.",
      "In Polish, the job ending changes depending on the construction; no word like «a» or «an» is added before the job."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
